# The build context must stay narrow: only src/, models/ and the pin files
# are COPYed (see Dockerfile). This file is the second line of defense for
# context size and against leaking private material into the daemon.

# Private / owner-local data — must never enter an image or a context.
data/
**/gh-user/

# Version control, envs, agent scratch
.git/
.venv/
.scratch/
.muse/
.video_agent/
__pycache__/
*.pyc
.pytest_cache/
.ruff_cache/

# Agent-skill checkouts (serving does not need them)
.agents/
.claude/
.grok/

# Documentation, reports, benchmarks, specs (not needed at runtime)
docs/
reports/
scripts/
tests/
*.md
!README.md
# The split-volume assemble step runs at image build (see Dockerfile):
!scripts/assemble_models.py
